{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "1A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/liang-hui-wang-i", "title": "梁惠王上", "description": "孟子見梁惠王。王曰：「叟不遠千里而來，亦將有以利吾國乎？」\n孟子對曰：「王何必曰利？亦有仁義而已矣。王曰『何以利吾國』？大夫曰『何以利吾家』？士庶人曰『何以利吾身』？上下交征利而國危矣。萬乘之國弒其君者，必千乘之家；千乘之國弒其君者，必百乘之家。萬取千焉，千取百焉，不為不多矣。苟為後義而先利，不奪不饜。未有仁而遺其親者", "occurrences": 8, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "今", "id": "今"}, {"form": "刃", "id": "刃"}, {"form": "在", "id": "在"}, {"form": "孝", "id": "孝"}, {"form": "悌", "id": "悌"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "敵", "id": "敵"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "禽", "id": "禽"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "鄰", "id": "鄰"}, {"form": "靈", "id": "靈"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.521274293958875, "source": "義", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 3.2144214745188204, "source": "義", "target": "孝"}, {"weight": 3.2144214745188204, "source": "義", "target": "悌"}, {"weight": 0.2864923043161922, "source": "人", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 0.9457379332004561, "source": "人", "target": "刃"}, {"weight": 0.43491230943446546, "source": "人", "target": "今"}, {"weight": 0.2525907526405108, "source": "人", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.6580558607486753, "source": "人", "target": "在"}, {"weight": 0.9343092373768334, "source": "仁", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 2.70359585075283, "source": "仁", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 0.9457379332004561, "source": "仁", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 2.0104486701928845, "source": "仁", "target": "敵"}, {"weight": 2.0104486701928845, "source": "仁", "target": "今"}, {"weight": 2.2335922215070942, "source": "仁", "target": "在"}, {"weight": 0.9343092373768334, "source": "在", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 3.109060958860994, "source": "在", "target": "靈"}, {"weight": 1.3512030413086205, "source": "在", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 3.3967430313127753, "source": "今", "target": "禽"}, {"weight": 2.192770226986839, "source":